QEC Pipeline (JunctionHackathon)

The MIT License in LICENSE covers the code and documentation written for this
project by Tomasz Kazulak (commits from c922bb0 onward).

It does NOT cover the following third-party material, which keeps its original
terms:

1. Junction Quantum Hack 2026 challenge baseline
   Provided by the challenge organizers (Niklas Steinmann, Fraunhofer FOKUS),
   commits 5eae04f..6eeafb4 in this repository's history. The baseline was
   published without a license and is used here for the challenge. Parts of the
   pipeline (for example syndrome extraction and the Stim surface-code flow) were
   adapted from it.

2. IQM calibration data
   configs/calibration/emerald_2026-06-06T*.json are calibration observation sets from IQM quantum
   computers (54-qubit Emerald and 20-qubit Garnet), dated 2026-06-06 and
   added during the hackathon.

3. Hackathon teammate contribution
   The repetition-code route in the hackathon submission (tags
   hackathon-submission-2026-06-07 / junction-quantum-hackathon-final-2026) was
   distilled from code by a member of team gate_crushers. It is not part of the
   current main branch.

